# Governing specs. Kept out of the public repo at the owner's request.
# The constraint linter treats these two filenames as the only permitted
# location for Payload/Supabase references, so keeping them local also keeps
# scripts/check-constraints.mjs meaningful in CI.
/MASTERPLAN.md
/HANDOVER.md

# AI tool configs
.claude/
AGENTS.md
HANDOFF.md

# docs & examples not for the repo
README.md
assets/README.md
.env.example
